@startuml meetup_state_uml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

title Arranging a sale's meetup

[*] --> NoTimes : sale becomes active

NoTimes --> TimesOffered : seller offers a time
TimesOffered --> TimesOffered : seller offers or withdraws times\n(up to 3 at once)
TimesOffered --> NoTimes : seller withdraws the last time,\nor the offered times pass
TimesOffered --> Scheduled : buyer books a time\n(the other times are deleted)

Scheduled --> MovePending : either participant proposes a move
MovePending --> Scheduled : accepted (meetup moves),\nrejected, or withdrawn

Scheduled --> NoTimes : either participant cancels the meetup\n(sale stays active)
MovePending --> NoTimes : meetup cancelled\n(pending move withdrawn)

Scheduled --> Completed : sale completes
MovePending --> Completed : sale completes\n(pending move withdrawn)
Scheduled --> Cancelled : sale is cancelled
MovePending --> Cancelled : sale is cancelled\n(pending move withdrawn)
TimesOffered --> [*] : sale completes or is cancelled\n(unbooked times deleted)
NoTimes --> [*] : sale completes or is cancelled\nwithout a meetup
Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note right of Scheduled
  A meetup whose end time has passed stays
  scheduled; the next step asks the
  participants to confirm completion.
end note
note left of NoTimes
  Times start in the future, on or before the
  60th day after today. Offering checks the
  seller's other meetups; booking and moves
  check both participants'.
end note
@enduml
